  "description": "Drake is a Black man and a globally recognized celebrity. His image is used in the meme to represent a Black person, and his expression of satisfaction is juxtaposed with the text to imply that he is mocking or expressing approval of racial segregation. This is a form of racial stereotyping that uses a Black celebrity’s image to represent a stereotype or to imply that Black people are being treated as inferior or less than human in a public space.",
